//   (2) forward DFT -> complex array S
//   (3) guided mask in frequency domain
//   (4) inverse transform (ensure consistent 1/N scaling policy)
//   (5) discretize -> instance'
//   (6) guard(instance')
//
// Notes:
// - JTransforms packs real/imag in an interleaved double[] for complex arrays.
// - The user must implement guidedMaskInPlace according to (band, fLo, fHi).
